  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "獅子座の名を冠する量産型MSリーオーが「GUNPLA EVOLUTION PROJECT 第4弾」として初HG化！",
      "en": "The mass-produced MS Rio bearing the name of Leo is the first HG version of the \"GUNPLA EVOLUTION PROJECT 4th edition\"!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• EVOLUTION POINT「Fine Build（簡単組立）」で、新関節構造による可動域の実現と関節の組立時間短縮を実現し、塗装派ユーザーにもやさしい仕様になっている！",
      "en": "• EVOLUTION POINT \"Fine Build (easy assembly)\" realizes a range of motion with a new joint structure and reduces joint assembly time, making it easy for users who prefer painting!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 部位ごとに集約されたランナー構成と、アイコンを採用した取扱説明書で簡単組み立ててをサポート！もちろん最新フォーマットに落とし込んだデザインと精密なディテールを再現！",
      "en": "• Supports easy assembly with the Runner configuration organized by part and the instruction manual that uses icons! Of course, the design and precise details are reproduced in the latest format!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部メインカメラにはクリアパーツが採用され、シール無し、成形色のみで6色の色分けが可能！",
      "en": "• Clear parts are used for the main camera on the head, and it can be divided into 6 colors without seals and only with molding colors!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ドラムガン、ビームサーベル、シールドが付属！",
      "en": "• Drum gun, beam saber, and Seal are included!"
    }
  ],
